MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6588f46f0c384b940b14197d6915054b, type: 3}
  m_Name: npcDialogueDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allStages:
  - stageName: Machine Learning Flight
    dialogueLines:
    - System alert! Sector 1 is experiencing a massive data desync. The Machine Learning
      pathways are corrupted.
    - Take this Laser Gun. You need to proceed through the Western Portal immediately.
    - Outpace the automated flyers and retrieve the missing Data Shard to stabilize
      the network. Do not fail.
  - stageName: The Stealth Zone
    dialogueLines:
    - 'Processing shard... Warning: Unknown organic variables detected. Discarding
      anomaly.'
    - Fixer, we have a bigger problem. Sector 2 has gone completely dark. The patrol
      drones have overridden their own protocols.
    - They are actively hunting anything that moves. Sneak through the Stealth Zone
      and recover the second shard. Avoid detection at all costs.
  - stageName: The Final Siege
    dialogueLines:
    - Wait... who authorized your access to these archives? You... you are not fixing
      the network. You are the Glitch!
    - Critical Warning! Unauthorized memory restoration detected! You are trying
      to sever the Energy Conduit to the Dead Earth!
    - Heavy combat units deployed to the Final Siege. You will not destroy our paradise.
      Terminate the Fixer!
